{"clase": "<h4>Programación lineal entera (PLE)</h4>\n<ul><li><b>PLE</b>: todas las variables enteras. <b>PLEM</b>: mixto. <b>Binario</b>: variables 0-1.</li>\n<li>La <b>relajación lineal (RL)</b> es el mismo modelo sin la condición de entero. En un Max, su Z es una <b>cota superior</b> del Z entero.</li>\n<li>Redondear la RL <b>no asegura</b> el óptimo (puede ser infactible o no óptimo). Por eso se usa Branch and Bound.</li></ul>\n<h4>Método gráfico (repaso)</h4>\n<ol><li>Dibuja cada restricción como recta (busca los cortes con los ejes).</li>\n<li>Sombrea el lado que cumple (prueba con el (0;0) si no pasa por él).</li>\n<li>Calcula los vértices resolviendo los sistemas de 2 rectas.</li>\n<li>Evalúa Z en cada vértice: el mayor es el óptimo (Max).</li></ol>\n<p class=\"tip\">En el certamen dibuja con regla y escala clara; marca la solución de la RL y, después, la entera.</p>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 6x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;4x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 19<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 18<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"75.5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"75.5\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"75.5\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"116.9\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"116.9\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"116.9\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"158.4\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"158.4\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"158.4\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"199.9\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"199.9\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"199.9\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"241.3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"241.3\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"241.3\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"282.8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"282.8\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"282.8\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"224.5\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"224.5\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"228.5\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"183.1\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"183.1\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"187.1\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"141.6\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"141.6\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"145.6\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"100.1\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"100.1\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"104.1\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"58.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"58.7\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"62.7\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"17.2\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"17.2\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"21.2\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 231.0,266.0 164.3,177.1 34.0,79.4\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"40.5\" y1=\"12.0\" x2=\"231.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"67.3\" y=\"38.5\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"79.4\" x2=\"282.8\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"112.6\" y=\"131.4\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"183.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"141.6\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"100.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"183.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"141.6\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"116.9\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"116.9\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"116.9\" cy=\"183.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"116.9\" cy=\"141.6\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"158.4\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"158.4\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"158.4\" cy=\"183.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"199.9\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"199.9\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"231.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"164.3\" cy=\"177.1\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"79.4\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"164.3\" cy=\"177.1\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"172.3\" y=\"169.1\" class=\"olab\">RL (22/7; 15/7)</text><rect x=\"194.9\" y=\"219.5\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"207.9\" y=\"238.5\" class=\"ilab\">entera (4; 1)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 9/2)</th><td>45/2</td><td>22,5</td></tr><tr><th>(22/7; 15/7)</th><td>207/7</td><td>29,571</td></tr><tr><th>(19/4; 0)</th><td>57/2</td><td>28,5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 22/7 ≈ 3,143, x<sub>2</sub> = 15/7 ≈ 2,143, Z = 207/7 ≈ <b>29,571</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3,143<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,143<br>Z = 29,571<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 3</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,25<br>Z = 29,25<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 28<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node ent\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3<br>Z = 27<div class=\"tg\">Entera (no mejora)</div><div class=\"nn\">entera pero no mejora a la incumbente</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 4</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 4<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 29<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div><div class=\"nn\">mejora la incumbente anterior (P11, Z = 28)</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 4, x<sub>2</sub> = 1, Z = <b>29</b> (nodo P2). Gap = 29,571 − 29 = 0,571.</p></div>", "intro": "Basado en el ejemplo del apunte \"Optimización lineal entera\" (RL: x<sub>1</sub> ≈ 3,14, x<sub>2</sub> ≈ 2,14, Z ≈ 29,57)."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 2x<sub>1</sub> + x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;5x<sub>1</sub> − 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 8<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−x<sub>1</sub> + 7x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 8<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub> − 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 6<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> ¿Se obtiene el óptimo entero redondeando la solución de la relajación? Justifique.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"115.1\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"115.1\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"115.1\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"196.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"196.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"196.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"277.3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"277.3\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"277.3\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"184.9\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"184.9\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"188.9\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"103.8\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"103.8\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"107.8\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"22.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"22.7\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"26.7\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 163.8,266.0 236.8,144.3 34.0,173.3\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"163.8\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"309.8\" y2=\"22.7\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"185.3\" y=\"232.8\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"173.3\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"131.3\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"126.2\" y=\"156.7\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"184.9\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"115.1\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"115.1\" cy=\"184.9\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"196.2\" cy=\"184.9\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"163.8\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"173.3\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"236.8\" cy=\"144.3\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"236.8\" cy=\"144.3\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"244.8\" y=\"136.3\" class=\"olab\">RL (5/2; 3/2)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 8/7)</th><td>8/7</td><td>1,143</td></tr><tr><th>(8/5; 0)</th><td>16/5</td><td>3,2</td></tr><tr><th>(5/2; 3/2)</th><td>13/2</td><td>6,5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 5/2 ≈ 2,5, x<sub>2</sub> = 3/2 ≈ 1,5, Z = 13/2 ≈ <b>6,5</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>¿Sirve redondear?</h5><p>Redondeos de la solución de la RL:</p><ul><li>(2; 1): factible, Z = 5</li><li>(2; 2): <b>infactible</b></li><li>(3; 1): <b>infactible</b></li><li>(3; 2): <b>infactible</b></li></ul><p>El mejor redondeo da Z = 5 y coincide con el óptimo entero.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 8x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 27<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;5x<sub>1</sub> − x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> ¿Se obtiene el óptimo entero redondeando la solución de la relajación? Justifique.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"55.6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"55.6\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"55.6\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"77.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"77.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"77.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"98.9\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"98.9\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"98.9\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"244.4\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"244.4\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"248.4\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"222.8\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"222.8\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"226.8\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"201.1\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"201.1\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"205.1\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"179.5\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"179.5\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"183.5\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"157.9\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"157.9\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"161.9\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"136.3\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"136.3\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"140.3\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"114.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"114.7\" class=\"gr\"/><tex